      {
        "id": "commit-feb69b2a",
        "type": "commit",
        "timestamp": "2026-04-27T16:19:23-04:00",
        "description": "Remove regime features + tighten stop-loss to -3%\\n\\nRegime one-hot features (regime_low_vol/med/high) removed from\\nmodel input. regime_low_vol dominated XGB at 68% importance,\\ncausing all-hold deadlock in low-vol regimes. Continuous cond_vol\\nand atr_pct provide the same information without hard boundaries.\\n\\nStop-loss tightened from -4% to -3% to break stale position\\ndeadlock (SOL/XRP at ~-2.5%).\\n\\nXGB importances now more evenly distributed:\\n  atr_pct: 54.6%, vol_forecast: 15.4%, cond_vol: 13.4%\\nvs previous: regime_low_vol: 68%.",
        "project": "kuro-workspace",
        "url": "https://github.com/kuro-claw/kuro-workspace/commit/feb69b2a"
      },
